 "notes": "2021 Vinyl Reissue\nsticker \n\"Inclus Bouge de là, Victime de la mode, Caroline \"\n\n1991 Sentinel Ouest , 1991 Sentinel Ouest , sous licence exclusive Polydor, un label Univeral Music France\n\n200 copies were signed by MC Solaar via Vinylcollector.store \n\n\nRecorded in May 1991 at Studio Bastille.\nMixed in June 1991 at Plus XXX & Marcadet, Paris.\nPre-production at Jimmy Studio, Bagnolet.\nMastered at Masterdisk Corp. NYC. \nDesign for MapMond\n\nCome with inner sleeve with photos & lyrics\n\n(P) & (C) 1991 Polydor, France\n\nRunouts side A and B: The \"TL\" is combinded (see image on the [l191252] profile page).\n",
